        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nWe bought our car today and had a wonderful experience. We are very grateful to have met our sales consultant, Wei. He is extremely professional and truly cares about his customers.\n\nThroughout the whole process, Wei was patient, knowledgeable, and very warm and enthusiastic. He took the time to explain everything clearly and always considered what was best for us, which made us feel very comfortable and confident with our decision.\n\nHe also surprised us with a very meaningful delivery gift, which made this experience even more special.\n\nHighly recommend Wei to anyone looking to buy a car. Thank you again for such a great experience!",
        "time": 1766184731,
